<definition version="0.100.0" type="element" link_type="simple" width="60" height="70" hotspot_x="50" hotspot_y="30">
	<uuid uuid="{f4b408c7-ed43-5835-932b-47f3237c255e}"/>
	<names>
		<name lang="en">Lanbao PDB-CC50TGI laser distance sensor</name>
		<name lang="fr">Capteur de distance laser Lanbao PDB-CC50TGI</name>
	</names>
	<elementInformations>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer" show="1">Lanbao</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">PDB-CC50TGI</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">Capteur de distance laser 80-500 mm, sortie analogique 4-20 mA et sortie tout ou rien, 12-24 V DC, câble blindé 2 m</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="comment" show="1">Detection: laser distance measurement (red laser 650 nm, class 2), measuring range 80-500 mm (full scale 420 mm, data given for a 90 % white card), 4-20 mA analog output over the range, switch output Q (single point or window teach on the sensor)</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Laser distance measuring sensor (red laser 650 nm, class 2), measuring range 80-500 mm (full scale 420 mm), 4-20 mA analog output (load below 390 ohm) and switch output Q (push-pull, NPN or PNP, NO or NC settable), 12-24 V DC, OLED display and two keys, green power LED and yellow action LED, IP67, 2 m shielded 4-wire cable. Wires: BN +24 V, BU 0 V, BK switch output Q, GY analog output Ia (4-20 mA, the load is wired between Ia and 0 V). Mounting: two holes 4.4 mm (M4 screws), 65x51x23 mm. The cable shield is not drawn. Hole positions are read from the datasheet drawing (about 1 mm).</elementInformation>
	</elementInformations>
	<informations>Author: QElectroTech contributors
Original vector drawing, not copied from a manufacturer drawing. Ratings and terminal names from the public datasheet; layout and symbols are generic, check them against the datasheet.
License: see http://qelectrotech.org/wiki/doc/elements_license</informations>
